rale a n\u00e9cessit\u00e9 5000 heures de travail graphique, guid\u00e9 par des historiens.\nDe la nef \u00e0 la fl\u00e8che, admirez chaque perspective du monument, et finissez par un spectaculaire voyage en ballon au-dessus des arches, et de Paris \u00e0 la fin du XVIII\u00e8me si\u00e8cle. Le tout au son d\u2019une fantaisie de Bach jou\u00e9e sur le c\u00e9l\u00e8bre orgue Cavaill\u00e9-Coll !", "short_description": "Ubisoft propose une visite en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle de Notre-Dame de Paris \u00e0 partir de la reconstitution du XVIII\u00e8me si\u00e8cle extraite du jeu Assassin\u2019s Creed : Unity."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Mobile_Icon_EN.png", "id": "5505549282843861", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031325_5505549292843860_5100780693875841273_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ukXqLTlRuToQ7kNvwG7mWiy&_nc_oc=Ado07EsL5I5k2NhK4MWVJLeUuR4ljyUtIbJEVYDvGnXwghR-JTOIxlyWqFg_ZeX00NY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT2rvMX3zsa55c-ynTe7cvPvmdFiZ2iSEY-MCJ0IWuROA&oe=6AFB3478"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_EN.png", "id": "2626086864190393", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031371_2626086867523726_7267842356612940618_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6vi8kB-FfOUQ7kNvwF3D_GD&_nc_oc=Adp2cXESwij-mYxeXAJ02Gi2zH-4QQnvw4lCNNhT731ViZiMMJQqkaI7A8B1-_DeIho&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT31RmjTmr7zilI-KLtTU6mAwp-46zfAswi2eZ0Z5vi4A&oe=6AFB24D8"}, {"file_name": "VR_Landscape_EN.png", "id": "1543686999397216", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031515_1543687002730549_2548295266512135503_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7sylpyNqloUQ7kNvwG2p1HO&_nc_oc=AdobhQ0KK7AVA6PAYR5jBBHEsfDmwt1h6DZ